<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:lrc="http://lrc.red/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" lrc:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"><ttm:name type="full">Daft Punk</ttm:name></ttm:agent><sourceMetadata xmlns="http://lrc.red/lyric-ttml-internal" leadingSilence="0.040"><translations/></sourceMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="5:37.562"><div><p begin="26.491" end="30.411" lrc:key="L27253" ttm:agent="v1">I didn't want to be the one to forget</p><p begin="30.760" end="35.010" lrc:key="L27254" ttm:agent="v1">I thought of everything I'd never regret</p><p begin="35.173" end="39.218" lrc:key="L27255" ttm:agent="v1">A little time with you is all that I get</p></div></body></tt>